 "notes": "Sources: official Cerro Gordo County candidate list (revised 9/3/2026) cross-checked against all 34 precinct sample ballots. Supervisors are elected by district: only District 2 is on the ballot, appearing on 19 of 34 ballot styles (Clear Lake wards, Ventura, Clear Lake/Grant/Union/Lake/Lincoln/Grimes/Portland/Geneseo-Dougherty/Mason South-Bath-Owen/Mt Vernon-Pleasant Valley townships); voters see only their district. No candidate filed for one party in Treasurer/Recorder/Attorney (single candidate each). Falls Township Trustee (regular), Falls Township Clerk and Portland Township Trustee have no filed candidates (write-in only). Clear Lake Sanitary District Trustee race (vote for 3) appears on the 5 '_clsd' ballot styles. No county hospital trustee race and no local public measures on any sample ballot."
